{
  "schema": 1,
  "description": "Wants (docs/wants.md, supabase/migrations/0016_wants.sql). A want waits out a cooldown before it is decided. 'defaults': the cooldown thresholds a new owner starts with, in their currency: under smallUnder takes smallDays, under mediumUnder takes mediumDays, anything more largeDays, and a want with no price or in another currency unpricedDays. 'cooldown': the days a new want gets from its price and currency, unless the owner picked a number of days (picked wins, 0 to 365). 'coolsUntil': the planning day it becomes ready, the day it was added plus its days. 'state': cooling before coolsUntil, ready on and after it, decided once bought or dropped whatever the day; the day is the planning day, so 'now' is local time and before 'dayStartHour' it is still the day before. A deleted want has no state (null). 'progress': how far the cooldown has run on a day, 0 to 1, for the ring; 1 once ready or decided, and 1 for a want with no days. 'ready': the wants a day's notification names: not decided, not deleted, and ready on a day after the last notification's day up to this one, oldest first then by title; with no earlier notification only those that became ready this day. 'stats': bought and dropped counts, and the money not spent, the total of dropped prices in the owner's currency (other currencies and wants without a price are left out); deleted wants never count. 'cooldownsId': the id of an owner's one row of thresholds, a UUID version 5 of 'want-cooldowns/<owner, lowercase>' in 'namespace' (the reviews' namespace), so two devices that make it offline make the same row. 'notify': the one notification a day for wants (M8-05): at the owner's time on a planning day, the wants that became ready since the day of the last notification's moment at or before 'since' (the device's last look), up to today; nothing before the time, nothing once shown, nothing when switched off (time null). Quiet hours don't move it: the owner picked the time, like the review reminders. 'notifyNext': the moment the alarm waits for, the time on the first day an undecided want cools that is still to come. 'notifyStale': a notification on screen goes once none of the wants it named is still waiting (decided, deleted or gone). 2026-09-28 is a Monday. Needs (supabase/migrations/0025_wants_needs.sql): a want's 'kind' is 'want' (the default when the field is left out) or 'need', something to buy rather than wait out. 'cooldown' with 'kind' need is 0 whatever the price. A need is ready the day it is added and stays out of 'ready' (the notification) and 'stats'. 'needs': the open needs of a list (not decided, not deleted, wants left out), by 'needBy' (none last), then 'addedOn', then title ignoring case. 'needLate': whether an open need's 'needBy' is before the planning day 'today'; a need without one, or a decided one, is never late.",
